# Build context hygiene. There were no entries here before, so the image also
# carried this repo's .env (DB credentials) and stale build outputs into the
# intermediate layers. Note that `build/` matters twice over: setuptools
# assembles the wheel from build/lib, so a stale tree there becomes part of the
# wheel — the base image's build/lib/fd_open_data_mcp is exactly how the
# business wheel once absorbed an entire other project (253 files) and
# overwrote the 0.5.21 install with 0.5.16 code.
.git
.gitignore
.env
.env.example
.venv
build
dist
*.egg-info
__pycache__
*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.deepeval
.DS_Store
